{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-news-post-js","path":"/news/2026-10-30.Best-Student_Paper_IEEE_IS2/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p>Hadeel Omar, currently studying for an <em>MSc Artifical Intelligence</em>, received a best student paper award together with her project supervisor, C4DM academic Johan Pauwels. <a href=\"https://qmro.qmul.ac.uk/items/2bdf0105-5602-41d0-af7d-267a7150ff36\">\"A Comparison of Protocols for Server-Side Binaural Audio Rendering on the Web\"</a> was presented at the <a href=\"https://internetofsounds2026.ieee-internetofsounds.org/\">7th IEEE International Symposium on the Internet of Sounds</a> from 28 to 30 October in Cannes, France. The paper is based on the work Hadeel performed for her final year project while studying for a <em>BEng Computer Systems Engineering</em> in '25-'26.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Best student paper award at IEEE IS^2","date":"Friday, 30 October 2026","author":"Admin","image":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#080808","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/968f068d61fc8e61f725e5160c9ade85/7b1b2/2026-10-30_ieee-is2-2026.jpg","srcSet":"/static/968f068d61fc8e61f725e5160c9ade85/09e10/2026-10-30_ieee-is2-2026.jpg 471w,\n/static/968f068d61fc8e61f725e5160c9ade85/0a43f/2026-10-30_ieee-is2-2026.jpg 942w,\n/static/968f068d61fc8e61f725e5160c9ade85/7b1b2/2026-10-30_ieee-is2-2026.jpg 1884w","sizes":"(min-width: 1884px) 1884px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/968f068d61fc8e61f725e5160c9ade85/086e4/2026-10-30_ieee-is2-2026.webp 471w,\n/static/968f068d61fc8e61f725e5160c9ade85/3c82e/2026-10-30_ieee-is2-2026.webp 942w,\n/static/968f068d61fc8e61f725e5160c9ade85/ab3a2/2026-10-30_ieee-is2-2026.webp 1884w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 1884px) 1884px, 100vw"}]},"width":1884,"height":2112}}}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/news/2026-10-30.Best-Student_Paper_IEEE_IS2","breadcrumb":{"location":"/news/2026-10-30.Best-Student_Paper_IEEE_IS2/","crum